<div class="WordSection1"><span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12px;">Hi &lt; Customer name &gt;<br />
<br />
Thank you for your enquiry regarding the transport of your pet with Qantas Freight.<br />
<br />
You can view available flights, get a quote and book </span></span><a href="https://freight.qantas.com/retail-animals.html"><span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12px;">here</span></span></a> &nbsp;<span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12px;">.<br />
<br />
All pet travel information and pet travel forms are available on the </span></span> <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/pets.html">Qantas Freight website.</a> <span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12px;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />
<br />
<span style="background:white;">Additionally, please read our</span><span style="background:white;"><span style="background:white;">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>&nbsp;<a href="https://freight.qantas.com/pets/pet-travel-faqs.html"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">FAQs</span></a> &nbsp;<span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="background:white;"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;widows:2;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;float:none;word-spacing:0px;">&nbsp;to help ensure the most comfortable and timely travel for your pet.</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12px;">For Domestic Freight Terminal Locations including lodgement and collection hours, both Major and Regional, </span></span> <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/freight-terminals.html#australia">please click here</a> <span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12px;">.<br />
<br />
If you have any further queries please reply to this email or contact our customer service team on 13 12 13.</span></span></div>
